{'14:43:01': 2, '14:43:04': 7, '14:43:07': 17, '14:43:10': 29, '14:43:13': 41, '14:43:16': 53, '14:43:19': 67, '14:43:22': 79, '14:43:25': 97, '14:43:28': 107}
Additional context:
The given data represents every third value of a complete numerical sequence. The missing values between the given numbers follow the same underlying pattern. Your goal is to infer the rule governing the sequence and reconstruct the full set of numbers.
Desired output format:
Return a list containing the complete numerical sequence, including the missing values in their correct positions. Do not include any additional commentary, only the reconstructed sequence. Also return a list containing the timestamps of every single value.


